{"page":265,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"258","words":[{"text":"258","x":210,"y":144,"width":72,"height":35}]},{"text":"CHAPTER 03 • 트랜스-포트 계층","words":[{"text":"CHAPTER","x":585,"y":145,"width":125,"height":26},{"text":"03","x":721,"y":147,"width":33,"height":24},{"text":"•","x":788,"y":153,"width":13,"height":12},{"text":"트랜스-포트","x":831,"y":147,"width":131,"height":28},{"text":"계층","x":974,"y":145,"width":50,"height":29}]},{"text":"르게 비워지므로, 링크에서 기용한 대역폭을 붙잡을 수 있고(1바르게 혼잡 원도우를 개","words":[{"text":"르게","x":559,"y":269,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"비워지므로,","x":642,"y":269,"width":175,"height":37},{"text":"링크에서","x":834,"y":269,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"기용한","x":981,"y":267,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"대역폭을","x":1096,"y":266,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"붙잡을","x":1244,"y":266,"width":103,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":1360,"y":265,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"있고(1바르게","x":1411,"y":266,"width":182,"height":38},{"text":"혼잡","x":1611,"y":264,"width":71,"height":37},{"text":"원도우를","x":1696,"y":264,"width":131,"height":39},{"text":"개","x":1840,"y":275,"width":24,"height":37}]},{"text":"방), 그래서 큰 RTT를 가지는 연결보다 더 높은 처리율을 가진다lLakshman 199기.","words":[{"text":"방),","x":559,"y":327,"width":53,"height":38},{"text":"그래서","x":626,"y":329,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"큰","x":739,"y":331,"width":34,"height":34},{"text":"RTT를","x":785,"y":330,"width":104,"height":35},{"text":"가지는","x":902,"y":327,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"연결보다","x":1016,"y":325,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"더","x":1164,"y":325,"width":27,"height":37},{"text":"높은","x":1207,"y":326,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"처리율을","x":1291,"y":325,"width":136,"height":37},{"text":"가진다lLakshman","x":1440,"y":325,"width":283,"height":40},{"text":"199기.","x":1742,"y":330,"width":87,"height":36}]},{"text":"공평성과UDP","words":[{"text":"공평성과UDP","x":554,"y":431,"width":235,"height":42}]},{"text":"우리는 오로지 혼잡 윈도우 메커니즘을 통해 TCP 혼잡제이가 어떻게 애플리케이션의","words":[{"text":"우리는","x":553,"y":501,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"오로지","x":668,"y":501,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"혼잡","x":782,"y":501,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"윈도우","x":864,"y":500,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"메커니즘을","x":978,"y":499,"width":170,"height":39},{"text":"통해","x":1161,"y":500,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"TCP","x":1243,"y":505,"width":72,"height":28},{"text":"혼잡제이가","x":1329,"y":502,"width":176,"height":37},{"text":"어떻게","x":1520,"y":502,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"애플리케이션의","x":1639,"y":502,"width":223,"height":45}]},{"text":"전송률을 조절하는지를 살펴보았다. 많은 멀티미디어 애플리케이션이 이러한 이유 때","words":[{"text":"전송률을","x":554,"y":561,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"조절하는지를","x":702,"y":560,"width":203,"height":38},{"text":"살펴보았다.","x":918,"y":560,"width":176,"height":38},{"text":"많은","x":1112,"y":560,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"멀티미디어","x":1197,"y":561,"width":166,"height":38},{"text":"애플리케이션이","x":1383,"y":562,"width":241,"height":38},{"text":"이러한","x":1645,"y":562,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"이유","x":1764,"y":563,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"때","x":1839,"y":571,"width":23,"height":36}]},{"text":"문에 TCP를 이용하지 않는다. 이들은 비록 네트워크가 혼잡하더라도 자신의 전송률이","words":[{"text":"문에","x":550,"y":621,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"TCP를","x":629,"y":623,"width":106,"height":34},{"text":"이용하지","x":749,"y":620,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"않는다.","x":896,"y":620,"width":107,"height":38},{"text":"이들은","x":1020,"y":621,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"비록","x":1135,"y":621,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"네트워크가","x":1216,"y":622,"width":172,"height":37},{"text":"혼잡하더라도","x":1400,"y":623,"width":212,"height":38},{"text":"자신의","x":1625,"y":623,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"전송률이","x":1744,"y":623,"width":118,"height":45}]},{"text":"조절되는 것을 원하지 않는다. 대신에 이들 에플리게이션은 오히려 혼잡제이를 가지고","words":[{"text":"조절되는","x":549,"y":682,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"것을","x":700,"y":681,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"원하지","x":779,"y":681,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"않는다.","x":893,"y":681,"width":107,"height":38},{"text":"대신에","x":1018,"y":681,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"이들","x":1132,"y":682,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"에플리게이션은","x":1214,"y":682,"width":243,"height":38},{"text":"오히려","x":1471,"y":684,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"혼잡제이를","x":1589,"y":684,"width":175,"height":37},{"text":"가지고","x":1778,"y":684,"width":87,"height":40}]},{"text":"있지 않은 UDP상에서 동작하는 것을 좋아한다. UDP상에서 동작할 때, 애플리케이션","words":[{"text":"있지","x":551,"y":742,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"않은","x":630,"y":742,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"UDP상에서","x":710,"y":742,"width":175,"height":39},{"text":"동작하는","x":902,"y":742,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"것을","x":1054,"y":742,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"좋아한다.","x":1133,"y":742,"width":145,"height":39},{"text":"UDP상에서","x":1295,"y":744,"width":180,"height":38},{"text":"동작할","x":1494,"y":745,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"때,","x":1616,"y":745,"width":40,"height":36},{"text":"애플리케이션","x":1673,"y":745,"width":190,"height":45}]},{"text":"은 혼잡할 때 “공평한” 레벨로 그들의 등급을 낮추고 어떠한 패것도 손실하지 않기보","words":[{"text":"은","x":547,"y":804,"width":35,"height":35},{"text":"혼잡할","x":595,"y":803,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"때","x":714,"y":803,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"“공평한”","x":761,"y":803,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"레벨로","x":907,"y":803,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"그들의","x":1023,"y":803,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"등급을","x":1140,"y":804,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"낮추고","x":1260,"y":804,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"어떠한","x":1381,"y":806,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"패것도","x":1502,"y":806,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"손실하지","x":1621,"y":806,"width":136,"height":37},{"text":"않기보","x":1777,"y":807,"width":87,"height":39}]},{"text":"다는 일정한 속도로 네트워크에 오디오와 비디오를 공급하기를 좋아하고 가끔 패킷을","words":[{"text":"다는","x":548,"y":864,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"일정한","x":630,"y":864,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"속도로","x":742,"y":864,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"네트워크에","x":860,"y":865,"width":167,"height":38},{"text":"오디오와","x":1043,"y":864,"width":140,"height":39},{"text":"비디오를","x":1197,"y":865,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"공급하기를","x":1348,"y":867,"width":176,"height":37},{"text":"좋아하고","x":1538,"y":867,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"가끔","x":1696,"y":867,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"패킷을","x":1778,"y":867,"width":87,"height":44}]},{"text":"손실한다. TCP의 관점에서 보면 UDP상에서 수행되는 멀티미디어 애플리케이션은 공","words":[{"text":"손실한다.","x":545,"y":926,"width":144,"height":38},{"text":"TCP의","x":703,"y":926,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"관점에서","x":821,"y":926,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"보면","x":971,"y":926,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"UDP상에서","x":1051,"y":926,"width":179,"height":39},{"text":"수행되는","x":1247,"y":927,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"멀티미디어","x":1402,"y":928,"width":169,"height":38},{"text":"애플리케이션은","x":1590,"y":928,"width":237,"height":38},{"text":"공","x":1838,"y":935,"width":26,"height":36}]},{"text":"평하지 못하다. 이것은 다른 연결들과 협력하지도 않으며, 그들 의 전송률을 적당하게","words":[{"text":"평하지","x":547,"y":987,"width":96,"height":40},{"text":"못하다.","x":660,"y":988,"width":110,"height":39},{"text":"이것은","x":788,"y":988,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"다른","x":903,"y":988,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"연결들과","x":987,"y":988,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"협력하지도","x":1138,"y":989,"width":172,"height":38},{"text":"않으며,","x":1325,"y":989,"width":112,"height":38},{"text":"그들","x":1453,"y":992,"width":71,"height":35},{"text":"의","x":1539,"y":990,"width":30,"height":38},{"text":"전송률을","x":1590,"y":990,"width":138,"height":37},{"text":"적당하게","x":1744,"y":989,"width":119,"height":44}]},{"text":"조절하지도 않는다. TCP 혼잡제어는 혼잡(손실) 증가에 대하여 전송률을 감소시기고,","words":[{"text":"조절하지도","x":545,"y":1050,"width":170,"height":39},{"text":"않는다.","x":730,"y":1050,"width":108,"height":39},{"text":"TCP","x":853,"y":1054,"width":72,"height":30},{"text":"혼잡제어는","x":939,"y":1049,"width":174,"height":40},{"text":"혼잡(손실)","x":1127,"y":1050,"width":162,"height":40},{"text":"증가에","x":1304,"y":1051,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"대하여","x":1426,"y":1051,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"전송률을","x":1546,"y":1051,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"감소시기고,","x":1701,"y":1050,"width":164,"height":45}]},{"text":"UDP 출발지는 그렇게 할 필요가 없으므로 TCP 트래픽을 밀어낼 기능성이 있다. 오늘","words":[{"text":"UDP","x":545,"y":1117,"width":77,"height":29},{"text":"출발지는","x":634,"y":1113,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"그렇게","x":784,"y":1112,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"할","x":898,"y":1112,"width":35,"height":38},{"text":"필요가","x":946,"y":1111,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"없으므로","x":1064,"y":1113,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"TCP","x":1211,"y":1116,"width":72,"height":29},{"text":"트래픽을","x":1296,"y":1112,"width":141,"height":38},{"text":"밀어낼","x":1451,"y":1112,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"기능성이","x":1568,"y":1112,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":1723,"y":1111,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"오늘","x":1808,"y":1116,"width":58,"height":39}]},{"text":"날 연구의 주요 분야는 UDP 트래픽으로 인해 인터넷이 마비되는 것을 방지하는 인터","words":[{"text":"날","x":545,"y":1174,"width":35,"height":38},{"text":"연구의","x":595,"y":1175,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"주요","x":707,"y":1176,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"분야는","x":789,"y":1174,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"UDP","x":905,"y":1179,"width":79,"height":29},{"text":"트래픽으로","x":998,"y":1175,"width":173,"height":38},{"text":"인해","x":1188,"y":1174,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"인터넷이","x":1270,"y":1173,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"마비되는","x":1421,"y":1174,"width":140,"height":37},{"text":"것을","x":1577,"y":1174,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"방지하는","x":1660,"y":1173,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"인터","x":1810,"y":1176,"width":53,"height":41}]},{"text":"넷을 위한 혼잡제어 방식을 개발하는 것이다[Floyd 1999; Floyd 20%; Kohler 2Ⅸ)6","words":[{"text":"넷을","x":546,"y":1236,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"위한","x":628,"y":1237,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"혼잡제어","x":708,"y":1236,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"방식을","x":860,"y":1236,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"개발하는","x":977,"y