text":"다중","x":1695,"y":1538,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"병렬연","x":1779,"y":1538,"width":87,"height":40}]},{"text":"결의 시용을 막을 방법이 없기 때문이다. 예를 들어, 웹 브라우저는 종종 웹 페이지에","words":[{"text":"결의","x":547,"y":1600,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"시용을","x":628,"y":1600,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"막을","x":746,"y":1600,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"방법이","x":829,"y":1599,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"없기","x":949,"y":1600,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"때문이다.","x":1032,"y":1599,"width":144,"height":38},{"text":"예를","x":1194,"y":1598,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"들어,","x":1275,"y":1598,"width":77,"height":38},{"text":"웹","x":1371,"y":1598,"width":30,"height":37},{"text":"브라우저는","x":1418,"y":1598,"width":175,"height":38},{"text":"종종","x":1607,"y":1600,"width":71,"height":36},{"text":"웹","x":1695,"y":1599,"width":30,"height":37},{"text":"페이지에","x":1744,"y":1599,"width":120,"height":42}]},{"text":"다중 객체를 전송하기 위해 다중 병렬 TCP 연결을 시용한다(니중 연결의 정확한 수는","words":[{"text":"다중","x":546,"y":1661,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"객체를","x":629,"y":1661,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"전송하기","x":744,"y":1661,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"위해","x":894,"y":1660,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"다중","x":976,"y":1660,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"병렬","x":1060,"y":1661,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"TCP","x":1139,"y":1664,"width":72,"height":29},{"text":"연결을","x":1226,"y":1659,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"시용한다(니중","x":1340,"y":1659,"width":222,"height":39},{"text":"연결의","x":1578,"y":1659,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"정확한","x":1697,"y":1660,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"수는","x":1808,"y":1662,"width":59,"height":38}]},{"text":"큰 브라우저에서 설정된다). 에플리게이션이 다중 병릴연결을 사용할 때, 혼잡한 링크","words":[{"text":"큰","x":545,"y":1725,"width":35,"height":34},{"text":"브라우저에서","x":593,"y":1722,"width":202,"height":39},{"text":"설정된다).","x":815,"y":1722,"width":156,"height":39},{"text":"에플리게이션이","x":990,"y":1720,"width":235,"height":40},{"text":"다중","x":1244,"y":1720,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"병릴연결을","x":1328,"y":1721,"width":172,"height":37},{"text":"사용할","x":1513,"y":1721,"width":107,"height":38},{"text":"때,","x":1635,"y":1721,"width":42,"height":39},{"text":"혼잡한","x":1694,"y":1721,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"링크","x":1812,"y":1723,"width":55,"height":37}]},{"text":"밴드폭의 큰 부분을 얻는다. 예를 들어, 9개의 진행 중인 클라이언트/서버 이1플리게이","words":[{"text":"밴드폭의","x":547,"y":1783,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"큰","x":697,"y":1787,"width":34,"height":34},{"text":"부분을","x":745,"y":1784,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"얻는다.","x":865,"y":1784,"width":108,"height":37},{"text":"예를","x":991,"y":1784,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"들어,","x":1073,"y":1782,"width":77,"height":38},{"text":"9개의","x":1166,"y":1782,"width":84,"height":37},{"text":"진행","x":1270,"y":1782,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"중인","x":1351,"y":1782,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"클라이언트/서버","x":1435,"y":1782,"width":254,"height":38},{"text":"이1플리게이","x":1709,"y":1783,"width":155,"height":39}]},{"text":"션을 지원하는 전송률 R의 링크를 고려하자. 각 애플리케이션은 하나의 TCP 연결을","words":[{"text":"션을","x":547,"y":1845,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"지원하는","x":631,"y":1845,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"전송률","x":784,"y":1845,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"R의","x":899,"y":1845,"width":56,"height":38},{"text":"링크를","x":977,"y":1845,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"고려하자.","x":1093,"y":1843,"width":144,"height":38},{"text":"각","x":1256,"y":1843,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"애플리케이션은","x":1307,"y":1842,"width":244,"height":39},{"text":"하나의","x":1566,"y":1844,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"TCP","x":1687,"y":1848,"width":73,"height":29},{"text":"연결을","x":1779,"y":1844,"width":88,"height":38}]},{"text":"시용한다. 만약 새로운 애플리케이션이 만들어지고, 또한 하나의 TCP 연결을 시용한","words":[{"text":"시용한다.","x":546,"y":1906,"width":144,"height":39},{"text":"만약","x":709,"y":1907,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"새로운","x":791,"y":1906,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"애플리케이션이","x":909,"y":1905,"width":236,"height":39},{"text":"만들어지고,","x":1165,"y":1903,"width":179,"height":38},{"text":"또한","x":1361,"y":1904,"width":71,"height":36},{"text":"하나의","x":1446,"y":1905,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"TCP","x":1566,"y":1909,"width":74,"height":29},{"text":"연결을","x":1659,"y":1905,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"시용한","x":1777,"y":1905,"width":91,"height":37}]},{"text":"다면, 각 애플리케이션은 대체로 같은 전송률 R/10을 얻는다. 그러나 만약 이 새로운","words":[{"text":"다면,","x":547,"y":1968,"width":75,"height":38},{"text":"각","x":641,"y":1969,"width":34,"height":38},{"text":"애플리케이션은","x":690,"y":1967,"width":238,"height":39},{"text":"대체로","x":944,"y":1967,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"같은","x":1062,"y":1967,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"전송률","x":1147,"y":1966,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"R/10을","x":1262,"y":1965,"width":111,"height":36},{"text":"얻는다.","x":1391,"y":1965,"width":109,"height":39},{"text":"그러나","x":1519,"y":1966,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"만약","x":1641,"y":1966,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":1728,"y":1966,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"새로운","x":1776,"y":1966,"width":91,"height":37}]},{"text":"애플리케이션이 11개의 병렬 TCP 연결을 시용한다면, 새 애플리케이션은 R/2보다 많","words":[{"text":"애플리케이션이","x":548,"y":2029,"width":233,"height":40},{"text":"11개의","x":802,"y":2029,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"병렬","x":921,"y":2028,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"TCP","x":1000,"y":2032,"width":72,"height":29},{"text":"연결을","x":1088,"y":2027,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"시용한다면,","x":1202,"y":2025,"width":180,"height":40},{"text":"새","x":1398,"y":2027,"width":32,"height":36},{"text":"애플리케이션은","x":1448,"y":2027,"width":246,"height":39},{"text":"R/2보다","x":1705,"y":2027,"width":122,"height":37},{"text":"많","x":1839,"y":2028,"width":28,"height":37}]},{"text":"은 불공평한 할당을 얻는다. 웹 트래픽이 인터넷에 널리 퍼져 있으므로 다중 병렬연결","words":[{"text":"은","x":546,"y":2092,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"불공평한","x":594,"y":2092,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"할당을","x":745,"y":2090,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"얻는다.","x":862,"y":2089,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"웹","x":986,"y":2089