 구현하였다. 즉 TCP는 네트워크 계","words":[{"text":"3.7.1","x":549,"y":2493,"width":69,"height":29},{"text":"절에서","x":628,"y":2489,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"배운바와","x":744,"y":2487,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"같이","x":894,"y":2487,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"종단간의","x":975,"y":2486,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"혼잡제어를","x":1126,"y":2486,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"구현하였다.","x":1312,"y":2487,"width":180,"height":38},{"text":"즉","x":1510,"y":2488,"width":36,"height":36},{"text":"TCP는","x":1560,"y":2489,"width":112,"height":35},{"text":"네트워크","x":1688,"y":2486,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"계","x":1838,"y":2486,"width":25,"height":38}]},{"text":"층으로 부터는 어떠한 명시적인 혼잡표시를 받지 않는다. 대신 패킷의 손실로부터 혼","words":[{"text":"층으로","x":549,"y":2549,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"부터는","x":665,"y":2550,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"어떠한","x":783,"y":2549,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"명시적인","x":900,"y":2547,"width":132,"height":40},{"text":"혼잡표시를","x":1048,"y":2547,"width":170,"height":38},{"text":"받지","x":1234,"y":2548,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"않는다.","x":1318,"y":2549,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"대신","x":1446,"y":2549,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"패킷의","x":1531,"y":2549,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"손실로부터","x":1651,"y":2547,"width":169,"height":39},{"text":"혼","x":1837,"y":2548,"width":29,"height":37}]},{"text":"잡을 추측할 뿐이다. 최근에는 네트워크가 명시적으로 TCP 송신자와 수신자에게 혼잡","words":[{"text":"잡을","x":551,"y":2610,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"추측할","x":629,"y":2611,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"뿐이다.","x":742,"y":2611,"width":109,"height":37},{"text":"최근에는","x":867,"y":2611,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"네트워크가","x":1016,"y":2610,"width":168,"height":39},{"text":"명시적으로","x":1198,"y":2611,"width":169,"height":38},{"text":"TCP","x":1378,"y":2615,"width":73,"height":29},{"text":"송신자와","x":1464,"y":2610,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"수신자에게","x":1618,"y":2610,"width":173,"height":38},{"text":"혼잡","x":1805,"y":2609,"width":60,"height":37}]}]}